---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="關於 Jabee | Jabee's Blog - Jabee姜的自我介紹"
  description="認識 Jabee姜 - 中正資工碩士生、攝影愛好者。了解 Jabee 的學經歷、興趣和個人專案。"
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-8">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-10 mb-16 items-start">
      <div class="flex-1">
        <h1
          class="text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 dark:text-white sm:text-5xl mb-6"
        >
          歡迎
        </h1>
        <div class="space-y-4 text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
          <p>我是 Jabee 姜，目前就讀國立中正大學資訊工程研究所！是個基督徒～</p>
          <p>
            認真來講，我超愛資工系，我真的很愛學各種電腦的技術、新知。但人生不只寫code，還有很多可以去學、去探索的地方。
          </p>
          <p>
            所以除了電腦科學相關的，在這個 Blog
            裡面，我還會分享我旅遊的經驗，騎重機的經驗，我的所見所聞，甚至於日常瑣事的閒聊，期待用這個
            Blog 記錄自己的人生。
          </p>
        </div>

        <h2
          class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 dark:text-white mt-8 mb-4"
        >
          我的興趣
        </h2>
        <ul
          class="list-disc pl-6 text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-2 marker:text-gray-400"
        >
          <li>攝影</li>
          <li>旅遊</li>
          <li>看各種yt影片（中文、非中文）</li>
          <li>組電腦</li>
          <li>還有太多了xd</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="flex-1">
        <img
          src="/images/IMG_0577.JPEG"
          alt="Jabee"
          class="w-full h-auto rounded-xl shadow-lg object-cover"
        />
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2
        class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-6"
      >
        Contact me
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-3 text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300">
        <p>
          Email: <a
            href="mailto:jabee@jabee.net"
            class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white hover:text-gray-600 dark:hover:text-gray-300 underline underline-offset-4 decoration-gray-300 hover:decoration-gray-600 dark:decoration-gray-700 dark:hover:decoration-gray-300 transition-colors break-all"
            >jabee[at]jabee.net</a
          >
        </p>
        <p>
          Github: <a
            href="https://github.com/jabee0228"
            class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white hover:text-gray-600 dark:hover:text-gray-300 underline underline-offset-4 decoration-gray-300 hover:decoration-gray-600 dark:decoration-gray-700 dark:hover:decoration-gray-300 transition-colors break-all"
            >https://github.com/jabee0228</a
          >
        </p>
        <p>
          Linkedin: <a
            href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/jameschiang0228/"
            class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white hover:text-gray-600 dark:hover:text-gray-300 underline underline-offset-4 decoration-gray-300 hover:decoration-gray-600 dark:decoration-gray-700 dark:hover:decoration-gray-300 transition-colors break-all"
            >https://www.linkedin.com/in/jameschiang0228/</a
          >
        </p>
        <p class="mt-4">期待身為讀者你的來信！</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2
        class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4"
      >
        關於我的文章
      </h2>
      <ul
        class="list-disc pl-6 text-lg text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 space-y-2 marker:text-gray-400"
      >
        <li>
          <a
            href="/notes/241121"
            class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white hover:text-gray-600 dark:hover:text-gray-300 underline underline-offset-4 decoration-gray-300 hover:decoration-gray-600 dark:decoration-gray-700 dark:hover:decoration-gray-300 transition-colors"
            >我平常會使用的應用程式</a
          >
        </li>
        <li>
          <a
            href="/notes/241214"
            class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white hover:text-gray-600 dark:hover:text-gray-300 underline underline-offset-4 decoration-gray-300 hover:decoration-gray-600 dark:decoration-gray-700 dark:hover:decoration-gray-300 transition-colors"
            >我平常會看的 YouTuber 和 B站博主</a
          >
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2
        class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-8 pb-4 border-b-2 border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800"
      >
        🎓 Education
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div
          class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow"
        >
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-2">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">
              National Chung Cheng University
            </h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold mb-2">
            Master of Science, Computer Science and Information Engineering
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-300 text-sm">
            Jul 2026 – Jul 2028
          </p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow"
        >
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4 mb-2">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white">
              Chung Yuan Christian University
            </h3>
          </div>
          <p class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold mb-2">
            Bachelor of Science, Information and Computer Engineering
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-300 text-sm">
            Sep 2022 – Jun 2026
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2
        class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-8 pb-4 border-b-2 border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800"
      >
        🧑‍💼 Experience
      </h2>
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div
          class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow"
        >
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-1">
            Associate Software Developer
          </h3>
          <p class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-medium mb-2">
            Chung Yuan Christian University · Contract
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-300 text-sm">
            May 2025 – Jan 2026 · 9 mos · Zhongli, Taoyuan
          </p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow"
        >
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-1">
            Machine Learning Research Intern
          </h3>
          <p class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-medium mb-2">
            Academia Sinica · Internship
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-300 text-sm">
            Jul 2025 – Aug 2025 · 2 mos · Taipei, Taiwan
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="mb-12">
      <h2
        class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-8 pb-4 border-b-2 border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800"
      >
        💻 Projects
      </h2>

      <div class="mb-8">
        <h3
          class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4 pl-3 border-l-4 border-gray-800 dark:border-gray-200"
        >
          Active
        </h3>
        <div
          class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow"
        >
          <h4 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-2">
            Taking a Break
          </h4>
          <p class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-medium text-sm mb-2">
            Current Status
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 text-sm mb-4">
            Currently taking a break from active project development to focus on
            learning and personal growth.
          </p>
          <div class="flex gap-2">
            <span
              class="px-2 py-1 text-xs font-medium border border-gray-300 dark:border-gray-600 rounded-md text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300"
              >😴 Zzzzzz...</span
            >
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3
          class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 dark:text-white mb-4 pl-3 border-l-4 border-gray-800 dark:border-gray-200"
        >
          Discontinued
        </h3>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div
            class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow"
          >
            <h4 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">
              <a
                href="https://github.com/jabee0228/SubtitleLLM"
                class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white hover:text-gray-600 dark:hover:text-gray-400 transition-colors"
                >SubtitleLLM</a
              >
            </h4>
            <p class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-medium text-sm mb-2">
              2025
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 text-sm mb-4">
              An intelligent automatic video subtitle generation system that
              combines OpenAI Whisper speech recognition with LLM correction for
              high-quality subtitle creation.
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              <span
                class="px-2 py-1 text-xs font-medium border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 rounded-md"
                >Python</span
              >
              <span
                class="px-2 py-1 text-xs font-medium border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 rounded-md"
                >Whisper</span
              >
            </div>
          </div>
          <div
            class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow"
          >
            <h4 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">
              <a
                href="https://github.com/jabee0228/PerspectiveFill"
                class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white hover:text-gray-600 dark:hover:text-gray-400 transition-colors"
                >PerspectiveFill</a
              >
            </h4>
            <p class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-medium text-sm mb-2">
              2024 - 2025
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 text-sm mb-4">
              Image Inpainting Methods via Various Perspective Image Synthesis
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              <span
                class="px-2 py-1 text-xs font-medium border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 rounded-md"
                >Python</span
              >
              <span
                class="px-2 py-1 text-xs font-medium border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 rounded-md"
                >TensorFlow</span
              >
              <span
                class="px-2 py-1 text-xs font-medium border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 rounded-md"
                >Vue</span
              >
            </div>
          </div>
          <div
            class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow"
          >
            <h4 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">
              <a
                href="https://github.com/jabee0228/CYCU-ICE-PL-INTERPRETER"
                class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white hover:text-gray-600 dark:hover:text-gray-400 transition-colors"
                >Scheme Interpreter</a
              >
            </h4>
            <p class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-medium text-sm mb-2">
              2025
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 text-sm mb-4">
              Our-Scheme Interpreter source code
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              <span
                class="px-2 py-1 text-xs font-medium border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 rounded-md"
                >Python</span
              >
              <span
                class="px-2 py-1 text-xs font-medium border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 rounded-md"
                >Scheme</span
              >
            </div>
          </div>
          <div
            class="bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow"
          >
            <h4 class="text-lg font-bold mb-2">
              <a
                href="https://github.com/jabee0228/BestYTBot-Discord"
                class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white hover:text-gray-600 dark:hover:text-gray-400 transition-colors"
                >BestYTBot-Discord</a
              >
            </h4>
            <p class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-medium text-sm mb-2">
              2025
            </p>
            <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-300 text-sm mb-4">
              Play Youtube on Discord
            </p>
            <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
              <span
                class="px-2 py-1 text-xs font-medium border border-gray-200 dark:border-gray-700 bg-gray-100 dark:bg-gray-800 text-gray-700 dark:text-gray-300 rounded-md"
                >Python</span
              >
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
